{"publicId":"fb563ef6-892b-41ae-b643-b7c78dfb09b5","title":"NEJM发表皮肤炭疽病诊断与治疗新进展","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T10:00:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T10:00:01.000Z","digest":"《新英格兰医学杂志》(NEJM) 2026年11月18日发表研究，提出皮肤炭疽病早期识别和抗生素治疗的新建议【新】。皮肤炭疽病由炭疽杆菌引起，典型症状包括无痛性水疱或溃疡伴周围组织坏死，常见于接触感染动物或其产品的患者。该研究强调早期抗生素干预可显著降低死亡率，但未提供具体剂量或适用人群数据【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-19T09:39:58.544Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"皮肤炭疽病","latestReport":{"id":"ujtpn5ctgcvt2wy5kxbg2d8jc"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fTp3W1tZrjv0","title":"发表","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T10:00:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ujtpn5ctgcvt2wy5kxbg2d8jc","title":"皮肤炭疽病","summary":"NEJM 报道了皮肤炭疽病的诊断与治疗新进展，强调早期识别和抗生素治疗的重要性。","source":{"name":"NEJM","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T10:00:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"ujtpn5ctgcvt2wy5kxbg2d8jc","title":"皮肤炭疽病","summary":"NEJM 报道了皮肤炭疽病的诊断与治疗新进展，强调早期识别和抗生素治疗的重要性。","source":{"name":"NEJM","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T10:00:01.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"ujtpn5ctgcvt2wy5kxbg2d8jc","title":"皮肤炭疽病","summary":"NEJM 报道了皮肤炭疽病的诊断与治疗新进展，强调早期识别和抗生素治疗的重要性。","source":{"name":"NEJM","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T10:00:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-19T10:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T11:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T12:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T13:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T14:00:00.000Z","heat":4.5,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[{"slug":"nejm","name":"NEJM"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}]}